| :--------------------- | :-------------------- | :-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Observability**      | Prometheus, Grafana   | Metrics collection (e.g., from Spring Boot Actuator) and visualization for gateway and services.    |
|                        | Jaeger, OpenTelemetry | Distributed tracing for end-to-end request flow analysis across gateway and microservices.          |
|                        | ELK Stack             | Centralized logging, aggregation, search, and analysis of gateway and service logs.                 |
